    python -I ZrlRetopoBench.py out_dir [--only arch,manny,lily,eucalyptus,car] [--set key=value ...] [--cars CAR_body_door_L,...]
The verifier is tested in both directions : `python -I ZrlRetopoBench.py --selftest` checks that the gates turn RED on a deliberately broken result (a folded quad, an asymmetric half, a lost component) and GREEN on a perfect grid.
